#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:5
msgid "Multi-Modal Serving"
msgstr "多模态服务"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:7
msgid ""
"AIBrix serves multi-modal models through omni inference engines, and "
"supports two of them: `vLLM-Omni <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-"
"omni/en/stable/>`_ and `SGLang-Omni <https://github.com/sgl-project"
"/sglang-omni>`_. Both expose OpenAI-compatible endpoints beyond text chat"
" — speech and general audio and, for vLLM-Omni, image and video "
"generation as well. AIBrix's gateway understands these endpoints "
"natively. It routes each request to the right backend pods by request "
"path and ``model`` name, whichever engine serves the model, and for video"
" generation it also keeps track of which pod owns each in-progress job so"
" follow-up calls land back on it."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 通过 omni 推理引擎提供多模态模型服务，目前支持其中两种：`vLLM-Omni "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-omni/en/stable/>`_ 和 `SGLang-Omni "
"<https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang-omni>`_ 。两者都在文本对话之外提供 OpenAI "
"兼容端点——语音与通用音频，以及（vLLM-Omni 额外提供的）图像和视频生成。AIBrix "
"网关原生识别这些端点：无论模型由哪种引擎提供服务，它都按请求路径和 ``model`` 名称将每个请求路由到正确的后端 "
"Pod；对于视频生成，它还会跟踪每个进行中任务由哪个 Pod 持有，以便后续调用回到同一 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:9
msgid ""
"The :ref:`supported endpoints <multimodal-supported-endpoints>` below "
"list what each engine offers and which of those endpoints the AIBrix "
"gateway supports. Setup that every modality shares — deploying a model "
"and reaching the gateway — is covered on this page. The guides then go "
"modality by modality: :doc:`Chat Completions <omni-chat>`, :doc:`Audio "
"<omni-audio>`, :doc:`Image <omni-image>` and :doc:`Video <omni-video>`."
msgstr ""
"下方的 :ref:`支持的端点 <multimodal-supported-endpoints>` 列出了各引擎提供的端点，以及其中哪些受 "
"AIBrix 网关支持。所有模态共用的准备工作——部署模型并访问网关——都在本页介绍。随后的指南按模态逐一展开： :doc:`Chat "
"Completions（对话补全） <omni-chat>` 、 :doc:`音频 <omni-audio>` 、 :doc:`图像 <omni-"
"image>` 和 :doc:`视频 <omni-video>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:16
msgid "Supported Endpoints"
msgstr "支持的端点"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:18
msgid ""
"The vLLM-Omni and SGLang-Omni columns show what each engine documents "
"upstream. The AIBrix column shows whether the AIBrix gateway supports the"
" endpoint, meaning it routes the request to the pods of the requested "
"model."
msgstr ""
"vLLM-Omni 与 SGLang-Omni 两列显示各引擎在上游文档中列出的端点。AIBrix 一列显示 AIBrix "
"网关是否支持该端点，即是否会将请求路由到所请求模型的 Pod。"

