#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:121
msgid ""
"In the engine columns, *Model-dependent* means the engine serves the "
"endpoint only for models that support the task, and *Not supported* means"
" the engine does not offer the endpoint, going by its upstream "
"documentation. A few AIBrix entries need a word of explanation:"
msgstr ""
"在引擎列中， *取决于模型* 表示仅当模型支持相应任务时，引擎才提供该端点； *不支持* 表示根据引擎的上游文档，引擎不提供该端点。部分 "
"AIBrix 条目需要补充说明："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:124
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/chat/completions/batch`` is routed like a chat completion, and"
" the engine answers with one JSON document that holds a choice per "
"conversation; see :ref:`omni-chat-batch`."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/chat/completions/batch`` 与 chat completion 一样被路由，引擎以一个 JSON "
"文档作答，其中每个会话对应一个 choice；参见 :ref:`omni-chat-batch` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:125
msgid ""
"``GET /v1/audio/speech/stream`` is a WebSocket endpoint, and the gateway "
"has no handler for it."
msgstr "``GET /v1/audio/speech/stream`` 是 WebSocket 端点，网关没有对应的处理逻辑。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:126
msgid ""
"``/v1/audio/generate`` does not match any of the gateway's reserved "
"routes."
msgstr "``/v1/audio/generate`` 不匹配网关的任何保留路由。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:127
msgid ""
"The three ``/v1/audio/voices`` calls name no model, so AIBrix reads it "
"from a ``model`` query parameter, and the voices they manage live on the "
"pod that served the upload; see :ref:`omni-audio-voices`."
msgstr ""
"``/v1/audio/voices`` 的三个调用都不指明模型，因此 AIBrix 从 ``model`` 查询参"
"数中读取模型，并且它们所管理的音色保存在接收上传的 Pod 上；参见 :ref:`omni-a"
"udio-voices` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:128
msgid ""
"AIBrix also serves ``GET /v1/videos`` itself, a catalog of your own video"
" jobs kept in the gateway's registry. It is not an engine endpoint, so it"
" is not listed above; see :ref:`omni-video-endpoint-reference`."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 还自行提供 ``GET /v1/videos`` "
"，即网关注册表中保存的、属于你自己的视频任务目录。它不是引擎端点，因此未在上方列出；参见 :ref:`omni-video-endpoint-"
"reference` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:133
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:135
msgid ""
"An omni engine pod is started the same way as any other model in AIBrix —"
" a ``Deployment`` labeled with ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` and a matching "
"``Service`` — with one engine-specific step. For vLLM-Omni it is passing "
"``--omni`` to ``vllm serve``: that flag auto-detects the model's task "
"from its architecture and exposes the matching OpenAI-compatible endpoint"
" (``/v1/images/generations``, ``/v1/audio/speech``, ``/v1/videos``, ...)."
" The examples in this guide use vLLM-Omni. For SGLang-Omni, start the "
"engine as its own documentation describes and keep the same labels and "
"``Service``."
msgstr ""
"omni 引擎 Pod 的启动方式与 AIBrix 中任何其他模型相同——一个带有 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 标签的 "
"``Deployment`` 和一个对应的 ``Service``——只多一个与引擎相关的步骤。对于 vLLM-Omni，是向 ``vllm "
"serve`` 传入 ``--omni`` ：该参数会根据模型架构自动检测其任务，并暴露对应的 OpenAI 兼容端点（ "
"``/v1/images/generations`` 、 ``/v1/audio/speech`` 、 ``/v1/videos`` "
"等）。本指南中的示例使用 vLLM-Omni。对于 SGLang-Omni，请按其自身文档启动引擎，并保持相同的标签和 ``Service`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:137
msgid ""
"Chat, audio and image requests are a single request and response, so "
"ordinary model-based routing is enough for them. Video generation is the "
"exception: a generated video is written to local disk on the pod that "
"created it, so the gateway also tracks each job and routes follow-up "
"calls back to that pod. See :doc:`omni-video` for how that works."
msgstr ""
"对话、音频和图像请求都是一次请求对应一次响应，因此对它们而言，普通的按模型路由就足够了。视频生成是例外：生成的视频会写入创建它的 Pod "
"的本地磁盘，因此网关还会跟踪每个任务，并将后续调用路由回该 Pod。其工作方式参见 :doc:`omni-video` 。"

