#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni.rst:123
msgid ""
"``GET /v1/models`` is answered by the gateway from its routing cache in the "
"configured installation namespace, whichever engine serves the model. The "
"default ``known`` mode lists every cached model name; ``ready-pods`` limits "
"the list to models with eligible Pods."
msgstr ""
"无论模型使用哪种引擎，``GET /v1/models`` 都由网关根据所配置安装命名空间中的路由缓存返回结果。默认的 ``known`` "
"模式列出所有缓存的模型名称；``ready-pods`` 模式仅列出具有符合条件的 Pod 的模型。"
